        "comments": "The assembly drMelAlti1.hap1.1 is based on 117x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. The order and orientation of the scaffolds on the following regions are uncertain: SUPER_8 23.07 Mbp - 28.69 Mbp, SUPER_8 33.22 Mbp - 33.90 Mbp, SUPER_8 71.81 Mbp - 72.41 Mbp, SUPER_6 68.67 Mbp - 69.09 Mbp, SUPER_4 31.03 Mbp - 31.34 Mbp, SUPER_3 31.34 Mbp - 31.60 Mbp, SUPER_1 88.12 Mbp - 88.46 Mbp, SUPER_1 87.06 Mbp - 87.33 Mbp",
